          "matched_text": "set aside",
          "start": 154,
          "end": 163
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "\nIt is prayed that in view of grounds of appeal, the impugned judgment dated 12.05.2017 and order on the point of sentence dated 18.05.2017 may kindly be set aside."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b2eea21f45d845c48f470c11c1dd619a_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the present appeal, amongst the other grounds, the main ground taken by the appellants is that the sample which was taken was not of the 'ghee' but of 'vanaspati'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e3656c3355cf48aa92c6ed9dfe37f3c5_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the appellants have not led any evidence before the Ld. ACMM on this aspect."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8481f8a811aa4a3989e89060d8929681_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, during the cross-examination of PW-1 and PW-2"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "35712f28a339438ebda4cd27809b12aa_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": ", there is not even a single suggestion that the sample which was taken was not of the 'ghee' but of 'vanaspati'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ccf3cb5742544b60b307f3e96775b94c_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said plea has been taken by the appellant No. 1 for the first time during SA u/s 313 Cr.P.C."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ae6d154b7f1743b0a66782fca80c5127_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Ld. ACMM in the impugned judgment has dealt with the said argument of the Ld. Counsel for appellants regarding the identity of the sample taken."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "31f6e05f7cac45d7a3f5022579c128cf_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He while dealing on this issue, has rightly noted that:\n\"the accused persons have never questioned the identity of the food article during trial."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5ea8403297fa45d3b01808c6cb1f3775_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That when the prosecution witnesses were examined, Kiran by Kiran Gupta Gupta 16:02:32 +0530 they categorically deposed that they lifted the sample of ghee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a9264b99bd934b74b5a94565405a5b51_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe defence never questioned them as to the identity of the article."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e69094fc8c06454d996d2cc640cacfe2_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
