      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the appellants have taken the said ground, however, they have nowhere described as to how and in which manner the deposition of witnesses were against the facts or Mahinder Kumar Khandelwal And Oth vs State on 30 May, 2024 Indian Kan"
    },
